MyPosLab
========

MyPosLab is a modified version of NexoPOS.

  Original project : NexoPOS
  Original author  : Blair2004 (https://github.com/Blair2004) and contributors
  Source           : https://github.com/Blair2004/NexoPOS
  Based on commit  : 053cea2 (imported 2026-11-24)
  License          : GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE)

Modifications in MyPosLab include rebranding (name, logo, icons and
user-facing text) and further user-interface changes. Internal identifiers
such as database table names (nexopos_*), permission names (nexopos.*),
API routes (api/nexopos/v4) and the config file (config/nexopos.php) are kept
unchanged so that existing databases and modules remain compatible.

